 {"image": "engenn6le03ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey, Peter. Welcome. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi, Vanessa. It sure smells good in here. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey, what have you got there?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, here is a dozen pieces of naan.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thank you. And what's this?", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le03ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: A pint of plain yogurt in case the vindaloo is too spicy for someone.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, how thoughtful of you! I'd better put that in the fridge.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sally is bringing a quart of mango ice cream.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Fabulous. Oh, you guys are awesome.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks so much for having all of us over for dinner.", "id": 2, "time": "14800"}, {"image": "engenn6le03ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, I love cooking for other people. The timing is good since John's home. I hope he brings Sandra. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'd love to meet her too. Hey, can I help with anything?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, in fact, would you mind chopping up some onions?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: No problem. I'd be happy to.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've got to saut\u00e9 them before adding them to the sauce. Then I'll need to let the sauce simmer.", "id": 3, "time": "32200"}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "type": "sena"}